From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AstroHybrid Team <astrohybrid@example.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf: slow load times, VRAM optimization, shader stutter (#140, #114, #92, #83)

Addresses: 
- #140 - Super slow load times when changing levels/dying
- #114 - VRAM usage is so high
- #92 - Shader stutter
- #83 - First-playthrough shader stuttering makes game unplayable without precompilation

This patch adds:
1. ASTROHYBRID_FAST_LOAD=1 - async asset loading with priority queues
2. ASTROHYBRID_VRAM_LIMIT_MB - configurable VRAM budget with automatic texture streaming
3. ASTROHYBRID_SHADER_PRECOMPILE=1 - background shader precompilation
4. ASTROHYBRID_PIPELINE_CACHE_WARMUP - warm pipeline cache on startup

